   "locked": false,
   "text": "drift stops checking a retired\nlesson. A fixed defect is not\nretired: okl update --status\nresolved keeps it briefed\nagainst its return.",
   "originalText": "drift stops checking a retired\nlesson. A fixed defect is not\nretired: okl update --status\nresolved keeps it briefed\nagainst its return.",
