   "text": "- [fixture_creds] Test fixtures use low-entropy fake credentials *(UNCHECKED)*\n- **FIX: Order lookups are scoped to the signed-in customer** [order_scope] *(UNVERIFIED \u2014 governs app/orders.py but no check has passed; prove it: okl verify order_scope --run \u2026)*\n- **FIX: Order lookups are scoped to the signed-in customer** [order_scope] *(STALE \u2014 app/orders.py changed 2026-11-02, after its last check on 2026-11-01; a lead, not a settled rule: \u2026)*\n- [token_in_storage] AVOID (retracted): Keep the session token in localStorage",
   "originalText": "- [fixture_creds] Test fixtures use low-entropy fake credentials *(UNCHECKED)*\n- **FIX: Order lookups are scoped to the signed-in customer** [order_scope] *(UNVERIFIED \u2014 governs app/orders.py but no check has passed; prove it: okl verify order_scope --run \u2026)*\n- **FIX: Order lookups are scoped to the signed-in customer** [order_scope] *(STALE \u2014 app/orders.py changed 2026-11-02, after its last check on 2026-11-01; a lead, not a settled rule: \u2026)*\n- [token_in_storage] AVOID (retracted): Keep the session token in localStorage",
